  581              
  582 00450  1375          TAD     BUF123
  583 00451  2375          ISZ     BUF123  /WHICH 8-BIT BYTE NEXT?
  584 00452  5277          JMP     XRD1    /WAS -1: ENQUEUE AS BYTE 3
  585              
  586              /BUF123 WAS -1: ENQUEUE RXBYTE AS BYTE 3, SPLIT ACROSS 2
  587              /BUFFER WORDS. SINCE THIS MIGHT BE THE FIRST BYTE OF A
  588              /RETRIED XMODEM RECORD, WE CAN'T ASSUME THAT THE T0P 4
  589              /BITS OF THESE 2 BUFFER WORDS ARE 0.
  590              /AC=-1 HERE
  591              
  592 00453  1374          TAD     BUFPTR  /DECREMENT BUFPTR
  593 00454  3334          DCA     TEMP2   /POINT TO 1ST OF 2 BUFFER WORDS
